  "description": "ExSheet's .xlsx support: a workbook read into a Workbook Document, every worksheet a Sheet with its constants and Formulas, beside an Open Report of what the file held that was not carried, and a Workbook written back to a file, each Formula with its Value. Anything that would change a Value is refused by name, naming the Sheet and the cell. No component, so a server converts files with no Blazor in the process. Ships at the same version as ExSheet.Engine and ExGrid.Data.Xlsx, and depends on exactly those versions.",
